    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – My Cat Is Sick?",
      "",
      "Today, someone said to me: “What’s wrong with you?”",
      "",
      "I heard “cat” and “sick”? So I answered him: “My cat isn’t sick.”",
      "",
      "That person looked at me very strangely and said:",
      "“There really is something wrong with you!” finished talking and walked away.",
      "",
      "Only afterward did I realize that what he said was “have something wrong”, and not “the cat is sick”.",
      "He was cursing at me.",
      ""
